# 排除开发/运行时无关内容。注意：被 Dockerfile 专用 COPY 引用的路径
# （bin/, wheelhouse/, *.sha256, requirements-lock.txt）绝不能在此排除，
# 否则 COPY 会因上下文缺少该路径而失败。运行时依赖通过 COPY 目录白名单
# 显式挑选，wheelhouse/bin 不会进入最终镜像层。
.git
__pycache__
*.pyc
.venv
venv
.venv-312
.venv312
node_modules
*.log
.pytest_cache
.ruff_cache
# Production images must not contain test fixtures, demo data, or the retired
# RCA implementation. They remain available in the source tree for local
# tests only and are never importable from a production image layer.
tests/
**/tests/
.pytest_cache/
.ruff_cache/
multicluster_demo.py
rca_engine_legacy.py
*.ses
